  "Cross-checked: 'kenyon': true where Kenyon's 1893 text gives the same reference (OCR, so a false is not necessarily a disagreement)",
  "Five references garbled in the Wikipedia table (3-5-3, 3-5-6, 4-2-1, 5-4-5, 6-4-3) corrected from Kenyon's text: all Iliad"
